~ start_cow_pasture_box

Pasture Box: Would you like to feed your cow?
- Yes
	Player: Yeah! Lets feed my cows.
	do GameDialogueManager.action_feed_animals()
- No
	Player: No, I don't need to feed them.
=> END

~ start_chicken_pasture_box

Pasture Box: Would you like to feed your chickens?
- Yes
	Player: Yeah! Lets feed them.
	do GameDialogueManager.action_feed_animals()
- No
	Player: No, I don't need to feed them.
=> END

~ not_enough_corn
Pasture Box: You don't have enough corn.
Pasture Box: You need 2 corns
=> END

~ start_shop
set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty = 0
Shopkeeper: Welcome! Are you looking to buy some fresh seeds, or are you looking to sell your harvested goods?
- Open Buying Shop
	=> buy_menu
- Open Selling Shop
	=> sell_menu
- Leave
	Shopkeeper: Happy farming!
=> END

~ buy_menu
Shopkeeper: What seeds do you need?
- Corn Seeds (25 Gold each)
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_item_type = "corn_seeds"
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_price = 25
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_tool_enum = "PlantCorn"
	=> buy_qty_select
- Tomato Seeds (30 Gold each)
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_item_type = "tomato_seeds"
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_price = 30
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_tool_enum = "PlantTomato"
	=> buy_qty_select
- Back to Main Menu
	=> start_shop

~ buy_qty_select
Shopkeeper: How many would you like? (Current: {{InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty}}) | Total Cost: {{InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty * InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_price}} Gold
- Add +1 Item
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty += 1
	=> buy_qty_select
- Add +5 Items
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty += 5
	=> buy_qty_select
- Remove -1 Item
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty -= 1
	=> buy_qty_select
- Remove -5 Items
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty -= 5
	=> buy_qty_select
- Confirm Purchase
	if InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty > 0 and InventoryManager.current_shop.buy_seeds(InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_item_type, DataTypes.Tools[InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_tool_enum], InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_price, InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty):
		Shopkeeper: Excellent! Added to your tool panel.
	else:
		Shopkeeper: Sorry, the transaction failed!
	=> start_shop
- Cancel / Go Back
	=> buy_menu

~ sell_menu
Shopkeeper: I'm buying all kinds of farm goods today. What are you looking to sell?
- Sell Raw Resources (Log / Stone)
	=> sell_resources
- Sell Harvested Crops (Corn / Tomato)
	=> sell_crops
- Sell Animal Products (Milk / Egg)
	=> sell_animals
- Back to Main Menu
	=> start_shop

~ sell_resources
Shopkeeper: Looking to sell some materials?
- Logs (10 Gold each)
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_item_type = "log"
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_price = 10
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_prev_menu = "sell_resources"
	=> sell_qty_select
- Stone (12 Gold each)
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_item_type = "stone"
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_price = 12
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_prev_menu = "sell_resources"
	=> sell_qty_select
- Go Back
	=> sell_menu

~ sell_crops
Shopkeeper: Fresh out of the fields, eh? Let me see what you've got.
- Corn (40 Gold each)
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_item_type = "corn"
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_price = 40
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_prev_menu = "sell_crops"
	=> sell_qty_select
- Tomato (50 Gold each)
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_item_type = "tomato"
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_price = 50
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_prev_menu = "sell_crops"
	=> sell_qty_select
- Go Back
	=> sell_menu

~ sell_animals
Shopkeeper: Ah, fresh products straight from your barn!
- Milk (60 Gold each)
	if InventoryManager.player_level >= 4:
		set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_item_type = "milk"
		set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_price = 60
		set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_prev_menu = "sell_animals"
		=> sell_qty_select
	else:
		Shopkeeper: You need to be at least Level 4 to sell animal products to me!
		=> sell_animals
- Egg (20 Gold each)
	if InventoryManager.player_level >= 4:
		set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_item_type = "egg"
		set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_price = 20
		set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_prev_menu = "sell_animals"
		=> sell_qty_select
	else:
		Shopkeeper: You need to be at least Level 4 to sell animal products to me!
		=> sell_animals
- Go Back
	=> sell_menu

~ sell_qty_select
Shopkeeper: How many do you want to sell? (Current: {{InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty}}) | Total Payout: {{InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty * InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_price}} Gold
- Add +1 Item
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty += 1
	=> sell_qty_select
- Add +5 Items
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty += 5
	=> sell_qty_select
- Remove -1 Item
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty -= 1
	=> sell_qty_select
- Remove -5 Items
	set InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty -= 5
	=> sell_qty_select
- Confirm Sale
	if InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty > 0 and InventoryManager.current_shop.sell_item(InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_item_type, InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_price, InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_qty):
		Shopkeeper: Great trade! Here is your gold.
	else:
		Shopkeeper: You don't have enough items in your inventory!
	=> start_shop
- Cancel / Go Back
	if InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_prev_menu == "sell_resources":
		=> sell_resources
	if InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_prev_menu == "sell_crops":
		=> sell_crops
	if InventoryManager.current_shop.temp_prev_menu == "sell_animals":
		=> sell_animals
	=> sell_menu